{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "SUPER DEBT",
    "steam_appid": 3398160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398160/extras/530124b94ee1db5a134eb36ec5c6aacb.avif?t=1751396902\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS MONEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment that passes eats away at your bank account! Once you're out of money you die in one hit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through carefully crafted rooms chock full of enemies and bullets that will test your execution and reflexes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock a variety of different weapons with vastly different mechanics and playstyles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH A FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the whole game with a friend! Switch from One to Two Player anywhere at a moment's notice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT AND SELL</strong>\u00a0<strong>MODULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find modules that will strengthen your abilities in order to survive! Modules can be sold in a pinch if you're lookin' for some extra cash!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WITNESS A MOODY AND DIMLY LIT ATMOSPHERE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lovingly crafted pixel art, music, and art direction come together to create a unique experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MADE BY ONE PERSON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wow! Are they okay?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398160/extras/30f0935ec0c2c34b498801a6c3c58d6a.avif?t=1751396902\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Content Description:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains horror elements, mild blood and gore, and mild\u00a0language.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398160/extras/530124b94ee1db5a134eb36ec5c6aacb.avif?t=1751396902\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME IS MONEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment that passes eats away at your bank account! Once you're out of money you die in one hit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through carefully crafted rooms chock full of enemies and bullets that will test your execution and reflexes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock a variety of different weapons with vastly different mechanics and playstyles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH A FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the whole game with a friend! Switch from One to Two Player anywhere at a moment's notice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT AND SELL</strong>\u00a0<strong>MODULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find modules that will strengthen your abilities in order to survive! Modules can be sold in a pinch if you're lookin' for some extra cash!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WITNESS A MOODY AND DIMLY LIT ATMOSPHERE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lovingly crafted pixel art, music, and art direction come together to create a unique experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MADE BY ONE PERSON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wow! Are they okay?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398160/extras/30f0935ec0c2c34b498801a6c3c58d6a.avif?t=1751396902\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Content Description:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains horror elements, mild blood and gore, and mild\u00a0language.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Money is your life in SUPER DEBT! Fight to survive with an arsenal of wildly different weapons and upgrades. In this intense and challenging Twin-Stick Bullet-Hell Roguelike everything costs money, and we mean everything!",
